lor"":""#b3e5ff"",""scale"":[0.4,0.4,6.3],""version"":""5.51.4"",""position"":[-1.5,3.8,-2.25],""rotation"":[0,0,0],""strength"":50},{""text"":""\n### Static\n#### @emme\n###### The inexorable flow of time in front of an apparently immutable nature, an infinite wait waiting for change. An eternal moment that reminds us of the greatness that is hidden in the humblest forms of life.\n\n"",""type"":""richtext"",""uuid"":""762ea33b-3aa9-44ab-9a43-399eac3fdd37"",""scale"":[1,0.7,0],""script"":"""",""version"":""5.51.4"",""inverted"":false,""position"":[3.75,4.25,8.5],""rotation"":[0,1.57,0],""blendMode"":""Screen""},{""text"":""\n### Public relationships\n#### @balbèro\n###### To be bound without knowing it and to be bound without wanting it.\n\n"",""type"":""richtext"",""uuid"":""55300cef-e46b-4639-8e2c-02bd29ca32cb"",""scale"":[1,0.7,0],""script"":"""",""version"":""5.51.4"",""inverted"":false,""position"":[3.75,4.25,10],""rotation"":[0,1.57,0],""blendMode"":""Screen""},{""text"":""\n### Second Abstr-ACT\n#### @alessandronalli\n###### The world seen as a stage to represent the movement.\n######Different every time, surprising every time.\nWith this collection, I narrate the Acts of a show that has never been represented.\n"",""type"":""richtext"",""uuid"":""86e312ef-9350-4638-abd3-c69c5fca8714"",""scale"":[1,0.75,0],""script"":"""",""version"":""5.51.4"",""inverted"":false,""position"":[2.25,4.25,10.75],""rotation"":[0,0,0],""blendMode"":""Screen""},{""text"":""\n### Fear of Consciousness\n#### @faranush\n###### A journey into the spiritual and magical world, one where the human beings can aspire to walk only transcending laws that govern the Universe. A shaman would surely be at ease but still is a place of freedom and access is granted to everybody.\n"",""type"":""richtext"",""uuid"":""c01fc7cf-cd35-4432-9e49-8bbf8f3c6d01"",""scale"":[1,0.75,0],""script"":"""",""version"":""5.51.4"",""inverted"":false,""position"":[0.75,4.25,10.75],""rotation"":[0,0,0],""blendMode"":""Screen""},{""text"":""\n# Daffodil\n\n## @silviarighetti\n\n#### Still life post-modern natures and living bodies, a language that seems to combine East and West in a unicum never seen before, where eyes and looks seem to follow the viewer that cannot help but feel investigated.\n"",""type"":""richtext"",""uuid"":""ddcd79e1-7d5f-417c-892e-61734e6b67f3"",""scale"":[1.1,1.4,0],""script"":"""",""version"":""5.51.4"",""inverted"":false,""position"":[3.75,7.4,7.5],""rotation"":[0,1.5707963267948966,0],""blendMode"":""Screen""},{""text"":""\n### Lutscher piruleta a rayas\n#### @snafu_el_lobo_loco_sebastiano\n###### The strength of the human impulses permeates the artworks. Eros, fear, and joy seem to share the same moment in an infinite loop bringing the viewer in a state of feeling hybrid and controversial emotions.\n"",""type"":""richtext"",""uuid"":""4d133f1d-af57-4d5f-9732-480d67d98277"",""scale"":[1,0.75,0],""script"":"""",""version"":""5.51.4"",""inverted"":false,""position"":[2.25,7.2,10.75],""rotation"":[0,0,0],""blendMode"":""Screen""},{""text"":""\n### Still beautiful\n####@buda\n\n###### It doesn't matter who you are, because you will still be beautiful.\n\n"",""type"":""richtext"",""uuid"":""2849366c-e46e-41f1-bed1-9d5b3733ea95"",""scale"":[1,0.75,0],""script"":"""",""version"":""5.51.4"",""inverted"":false,""position"":[0.75,7.2,10.75],""rotation"":[0,0,0],""blendMode"":""Screen""},{""text"":""\n### Whim\n\n#### @andreadionigi\n\n\n###### Colour permeates everything, the artist too, who becomes an integral part of the artworks. Shapes looking like ongoing fluid and invite the viewer to dive into to understand the Essence.\n"",""type"":""richtext"",""uuid"":""60b70a7f-2b6f-499b-b484-9fa1429838e4"",""scale"":[1,0.75,0],""script"":"""",""version"":""5.51.4"",""inverted"":false,""position"":[-0.75,7.2,10.75],""rotation"":[0,0,0],""blendMode"":""Screen""},{""url"":""https://uniqueone.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/xdai/media/758286aab0413aa043b18220b36b5a0b"","